Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://github.com/linuxdeepin/dde-network-core

Package: fix-r8152
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, network-manager (>= 1.0), ethtool, iproute2, dbus
Description: Fix r8152 ethernet autoconnect for NetworkManager
 A NetworkManager dispatcher script that detects r8152 USB ethernet
 devices and configures their connections with proper autoconnect-retries
 and autoconnect-reset-retries settings to ensure reliable reconnection.
 Installs to /etc/NetworkManager/dispatcher.d/ and runs automatically
 when any network interface comes up.
